  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "An aromatic amide obtained by formal condensation of the carboxy group of 2-{[(4-carbamimidoylphenyl)amino]methyl}-1-methyl-1<em>H</em>-benzimidazole-5-carboxylic acid with the secondary amoino group of <em>N</em>-pyridin-2-yl-\u03b2-alanine. The active metabolite of the prodrug  dabigatran etexilate, it acts as an anticoagulant which is used for the prevention of stroke and systemic embolism."
  ],
